// 九尾狐 on all fours, for the skinned-mesh spike: the same chubby body
// as the four-legged Shiba (+z forward), a pointed muzzle, tall ears with
// dark tips, dark socks, red marks over the eyes, and nine tails rising
// behind in a bouquet, each three bones long so they swish one after
// another.
// The tails come from gen_tails.py: change them there and paste the
// output back in.
